---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/ui/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/ui/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us — FindSongKey | Free BPM & Key Analyzer"
  description="Learn about FindSongKey — a free, browser-based tool that instantly detects the BPM and musical key of any song. Built for DJs, producers, and musicians."
  canonical="https://findsongkeybpm.com/about"
>
  <Header />
  <main class="content-page" id="about">
    <h1>About FindSongKey</h1>

    <div class="about-highlight">
      <p class="about-tagline">
        A free, instant tool to find the BPM and musical key of any song —
        right in your browser.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>Our mission</h2>
    <p>
      FindSongKey was built with a simple goal: give musicians, DJs, and producers
      instant access to the tempo and key of any track without the hassle of
      installing software, creating accounts, or uploading files to the cloud.
    </p>
    <p>
      Whether you're preparing a DJ set, figuring out the key for a remix, or just
      curious about a song's BPM — FindSongKey delivers accurate results in
      seconds, completely free.
    </p>

    <h2>What makes us different</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>100% browser-based</strong> — All audio analysis happens locally on
        your device using WebAssembly. Your files never leave your computer.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>No signup required</strong> — Just drag, drop, and get your results.
        No email, no account, no paywall.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Professional-grade accuracy</strong> — Powered by the Essentia
        audio analysis library, the same technology used in academic research and
        commercial music software.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Camelot wheel support</strong> — Instantly see the Camelot code
        for harmonic mixing, making it easier to create seamless DJ transitions.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Privacy first</strong> — We believe your music is your business.
        No tracking of what you analyze, no server-side processing, no data
        collection.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>The technology</h2>
    <p>
      FindSongKey uses cutting-edge browser technology to deliver desktop-quality
      audio analysis without any downloads:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>WebAssembly (WASM)</strong> — Runs the Essentia audio analysis
        library at near-native speed directly in your browser.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Web Audio API</strong> — Decodes audio files locally, supporting
        MP3, WAV, FLAC, and M4A formats.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>RhythmExtractor2013</strong> — A multi-feature BPM detection
        algorithm combining onset detection, beat tracking, and autocorrelation
        for robust tempo estimation.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>KeyExtractor</strong> — Uses chromagram analysis and the
        Krumhansl-Schmuckler algorithm to identify the musical key with high
        accuracy.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who it's for</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>DJs</strong> — Quickly find BPM and Camelot codes for harmonic
        mixing and smooth transitions.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Producers</strong> — Match tempos and keys when sampling,
        remixing, or collaborating on tracks.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Musicians</strong> — Identify the key of a song to play along,
        transpose, or arrange covers.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Music students</strong> — Learn about musical keys and tempo by
        analyzing songs you love.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      Have feedback, suggestions, or found a bug? We'd love to hear from you.
      Visit our <a href="/contact" class="content-link">Contact page</a> to reach
      out. Your input helps us build a better tool for everyone.
    </p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
